          "narration": [
            {
              "id": "p9-social-family-conflict-care.notary-inheritance.demand-accounts-first.alt1",
              "key": "demand-accounts-first",
              "text": "旧账本摊开，纸页上的铅笔字迹深浅不一。{sibling}念一笔，{subject}就在边上记一笔，{official}的钢笔悬在遗嘱上方没有落。{parent}咳了一声，说屋顶那八克朗是自己看着修的。",
              "tone": ["bureaucratic"]
